#. Tag: para
#: calc-dayduration.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module computes the length of day as well as sunrise, sun-transit "
"(noon), and sunset times for any calendar date, for any location on Earth. "
"First fill in the desired geographic coordinates and date, then press the "
"<guibutton>Compute</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo calcula a duración do día, e as horas do amencer, mediodía e "
"solpor para calquera data do calendario e lugar da terra. Primeiro indique "
"as coordenadas do lugar indicado e a data, logo prema no botón "
"<guibutton>Calcular</guibutton>."
